	<body>
		<h1>Welcome to the UntitledDesktopEnvironment Void Linux repository</h1>
		<p>This repository is used for hosting all UntitledDesktopEnvironment packages, as well as all <a href="https://madladsquad.com">MadLadSquad</a> applications, for Void Linux.</p>

		<p>Packages are built for Void Linux, both glibc and musl, for x86_64 and aarch64. To use this repository add the following configuration to <code class="inline-code">/etc/xbps.d/untitled-desktop.conf</code>:</p>
		<pre class="sourceCode language-plaintext"><code class="sourceCode language-plaintext"># Void Linux packages for the UntitledDesktop project
repository=https://xbps.madladsquad.com/binpkgs</code></pre>

		<p>The same file works on glibc and musl systems: xbps picks the packages of your architecture. The packages are signed with our RSA key, which <code class="inline-code">xbps-install -S</code> asks you to import the first time it uses the repository (signed by MadLadSquad &lt;contact@madladsquad.com&gt;).</p>

		<h2>Available packages:</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>untitled-game-system-manager - Provides <a href="https://github.com/MadLadSquad/UntitledGameSystemManager">UntitledGameSystemManager</a>, a manager for containerised Linux game systems</li>
			<li>untitled-ibus-handwriting - Provides <a href="https://github.com/MadLadSquad/UntitledIBusHandwriting">UntitledIBusHandwriting</a>, an IBus handwriting input method for IBus</li>
			<li>ude-session-logout - Provides <a href="https://github.com/MadLadSquad/UntitledDESessionLogout">UntitledDESessionLogout</a>, a session logout utility for the UntitledDesktopEnvironment</li>
			<li>untitled-imgui-framework - Provides <a href="https://github.com/MadLadSquad/UntitledImGuiFramework">UntitledImGuiFramework</a>, an independent cross-platform desktop application development toolkit</li>
			<li>untitled-dbus-utils - Provides <a href="https://github.com/MadLadSquad/UntitledDBusUtils">UntitledDBusUtils</a>, a C++ wrapper on top of the low level D-Bus C API</li>
			<li>untitled-exec - Provides <a href="https://github.com/MadLadSquad/UntitledExec">UntitledExec</a>, a cross-platform fork and exec/CreateProcess wrapper library</li>
			<li>untitled-cli-parser - Provides <a href="https://github.com/MadLadSquad/UntitledCLIParser">UntitledCLIParser</a>, a parser for CLI arguments</li>
			<li>untitled-i18n - Provides <a href="https://github.com/MadLadSquad/UntitledI18N">UntitledI18N</a>, a i18n library</li>
			<li>untitled-open - Provides <a href="https://github.com/MadLadSquad/UntitledOpen">UntitledOpen</a>, a file dialog, URL and file opener library</li>
			<li>untitled-xdg-basedir - Provides <a href="https://github.com/MadLadSquad/UntitledXDGBasedir">UntitledXDGBasedir</a>, a better implementation of the XDG base directory specification</li>
		</ul>
		<footer>
